    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37520" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξολισθάνω</span></b> , later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξολεθρ-αίνω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Epicur.
			<u>Ep.</u>
			2p.45U.
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Sm.
			<u>Ps.</u>
			35(36).3
		</span></i>: aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώλισθον</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>glide off, slip away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ δέ οἱ ἧπαρ ὄλισθεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					20.470
				</span></i>
			; <i>glance off,</i> as a spear-point from a hard substance,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1383
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτῶν</span>
			<i>away from</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				590b17
			</span></i>; of leaves, <i>drop off,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				12.18
			</span></i>; <i>slip out, escape,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hippon.
				37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				141
			</span></i>; of things, Epicur.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				383
			</span></i> bis; of a bandage, <i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				188
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. εἰς ἡδονάς</span>
			<i>slip imperceptibly</i> into . ., <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				1.3.1
			</span></i>: c. acc., <i>slip out of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαβολάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					491
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς μήποτ᾽ ἐξολίσθῃ ἡμᾶς</span>
			<i>slip from</i> our <i>memory,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				286
			</span></i>.</div>
